---
import PageLayout from "../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { texts } from "../../../data/texts";

const works = texts.filter((text) => text.author === "Barzaj Samkough");
---

<PageLayout title="Barzaj Samkough">
  <section id="about">
    <dl>
      <dt>Name</dt>
      <dd>
        Barzaj Samkough (<span lang="ar" dir="rtl">برزج سمكوغ</span>)
      </dd>
      <dt>Spelling</dt>
      <dd>
        Also written “Burzaj”, as on the
        <a href="/people/amin-samkough/biography/">Amin Samkough biography</a>.
      </dd>
      <dt>Father</dt>
      <dd><a href="/people/amin-samkough/">Amin Samkough</a></dd>
      <dt>Born</dt>
      <dd>Unknown</dd>
      <dt>Died</dt>
      <dd>Unknown</dd>
    </dl>
    <p>
      Barzaj Samkough is a son of Amin Samkough. He is the author of the books
      listed below. The Amin Samkough biography says that after his father’s
      death, Barzaj issued a book called “An Introduction to Circassian
      History”, an introduction to Amin’s own “History of the Circassians”.
    </p>
  </section>
  <hr />

  <section id="works">
    <h2>Books</h2>
    <p>Books by Barzaj Samkough, from their covers. See all
      <a href="/texts/">Texts</a>.</p>
    <ul>
      {
        works.map((work) => (
          <li>
            <a href={`/texts/${work.slug}/`}>{work.title}</a>
            {work.kind && <> ({work.kind.toLowerCase()})</>}
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>
    <p>
      The cover of “An Introduction to the History of the Circassians” names
      Amin Samkough as the author. Its page is under
      <a href="/texts/an-introduction-to-the-history-of-the-circassians/">Texts</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
  <hr />

  <section id="family">
    <h2>Family</h2>
    <p>
      His children are Radwan and Narina. See the
      <a href="/family-tree/">family tree</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  dt {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-block-start: 0.5em;
  }

  dd {
    margin-inline-start: 0;
  }
</style>
